## sapper-v2

Upstream: https://github.com/N1nEmAn/sapper-v2
Pinned commit: 7b75e6f1f5d5b4ae0c55878b0dd0994d9b08f1fb
License: MIT

The engagement fact graph in `src/index.ts` and the node store semantics in
`src/store.ts` are reimplementations of the fact/intent graph and store design
from sapper-v2's `lib/sapper.py` (typed facts with a flat `data` map, intents as
edges with dependency `from` and produced `to`, a reserved `goal` fact, one JSON
file per node, id counters that skip occupied ids, path-safe id validation, and a
deduplicated loot ledger that records before submitting).

