## pentagi

Upstream: https://github.com/vxcontrol/pentagi
Pinned commit: cffed9485aa1cca70762cd08a57ac62a80406258
License: MIT

The typed execution boundary in `src/exec.ts` adopts the shape of pentagi's
terminal tool (`backend/pkg/tools/terminal.go`): bounded execution with a hard
timeout ceiling, captured output, and per-operation identity. The security
vocabulary used in `src/findings.ts` follows the node/edge taxonomy described in
pentagi's security prompt templates. Both are reimplementations; no Go source was
copied.

