## Not derived from either upstream

The typed finding model in `src/findings.ts` (severity ranks, CVE/CWE validation,
evidence records, dedupe and ranking) has **no upstream source**. Neither
sapper-v2 nor pentagi ships a typed finding, a CVE id field, or a CVSS score; both
keep findings as free text. Any claim that this was ported would be false.

The VXControl Cloud SDK is deliberately not used or referenced. Its code is
MIT but service access requires a separate license key and acceptance of separate
terms, so none of it is absorbed here.
